{
  "url": "https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/q0oyuts8zu",
  "title": "10分钟实现国家识别广告投放：Next.js + Cloudflare 最简方案",
  "author": "老菜",
  "authorAvatar": "https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/q0oyuts8zu_avatar.jpg",
  "tags": [
    "经验",
    "Cloudflare"
  ],
  "content": "<div>在最近的一次讨论中，哥飞提出了一个有趣的观点：仅依靠语言来判断用户所属国家存在较大局限性，这使得基于语言分类投放广告的策略并不够精准。恰好我在这个领域有一些实践经验，希望能和大家分享。</div>\n<div>通过 Next.js 和 Cloudflare 的配合，我们可以轻松实现根据访问者国家展示不同广告内容的功能。这个方案简单可靠，无需额外服务。\n接下来，我将以俄罗斯用户为例，为您详细介绍如何在10分钟内快速搭建一个可靠的用户国家检测系统。</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">前提条件</h2>\n<div>要实现这个功能，你需要：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>网站已经使用 Cloudflare CDN 服务</li>\n<li>确保在 Cloudflare 仪表板中启用了 IP Geolocation （默认是开启的，没关闭过就不用操作）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">工作原理</h2>\n<div>Cloudflare 会自动为每个请求添加 <code>CF-IPCountry</code> 头部信息，包含访问者的两字母国家代码。例如：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>俄罗斯访问者：RU</li>\n<li>中国访问者：CN</li>\n<li>美国访问者：US</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">代码实现</h2>\n<div><strong>1. 创建广告配置</strong></div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-typescript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: slategray;\">// config/ads.ts</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token module\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">export</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">const</span><span> adConfig </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span>\n</span><span>    </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">RU</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span>\n</span><span>        provider</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">'yandex'</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>        slot</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">'ru-123456'</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>        content</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">'俄罗斯市场广告内容'</span><span>\n</span><span>    </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>    </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">CN</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span>\n</span><span>        provider</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">'baidu'</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>        slot</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">'cn-123456'</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>        content</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">'中国市场广告内容'</span><span>\n</span><span>    </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>    </span><span class=\"token module\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">default</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span>\n</span><span>        provider</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">'google'</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>        slot</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">'global-123456'</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>        content</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">'全球市场广告内容'</span><span>\n</span><span>    </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span><span> </span><span class=\"token module\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">as</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">const</span></code></div></pre>\n<div><strong>2. 创建广告组件</strong></div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-typescript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: slategray;\">// components/GeoAd.tsx</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">'use client'</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">interface</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">GeoAdProps</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span>\n</span><span>    country</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">string</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token module\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">export</span><span> </span><span class=\"token module\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">default</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">function</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">GeoAd</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span> country </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">GeoAdProps</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span>\n</span><span>    </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">const</span><span> adData </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span> adConfig</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">[</span><span>country </span><span class=\"token module\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">as</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">keyof</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">typeof</span><span> adConfig</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">]</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">||</span><span> adConfig</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token module\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">default</span><span>\n</span>    \n<span>    </span><span class=\"token control-flow\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">return</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span>\n</span><span>        </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">&lt;</span><span>div className</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"ad-container\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">&gt;</span><span>\n</span><span>            </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span>adData</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">provider</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">===</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">'google'</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">&amp;&amp;</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span>\n</span><span>                </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">&lt;</span><span>div id</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span class=\"token template-string template-punctuation\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">`</span><span class=\"token template-string\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">google-ad-</span><span class=\"token template-string interpolation interpolation-punctuation\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">${</span><span class=\"token template-string interpolation\">adData</span><span class=\"token template-string interpolation\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token template-string interpolation property-access\">slot</span><span class=\"token template-string interpolation interpolation-punctuation\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 1